      "text_uthmani_tajweed": "مَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِكِ يَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٤</span>",
      "text_literation": "Maliki yawmi addeen",
